@Mec126_HostAddress = http://localhost:5130

### --- Authentication (users stored in SQL Server: AspNetUsers) ---

### Register new account (hashed password in DB, role = User)
POST {{Mec126_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "newstudent",
  "email": "newstudent@mec126.local",
  "password": "Student1!"
}

###

### Register first account (becomes Admin) — run once on empty DB
POST {{Mec126_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "email": "admin@mec126.local",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

###

### Register second account (becomes User)
POST {{Mec126_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "user",
  "email": "user@mec126.local",
  "password": "User123!"
}

###

### Login as Admin
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{Mec126_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

###

### Login as User (read-only)
# @name loginUser
POST {{Mec126_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "user",
  "password": "User123!"
}

###

@adminToken = {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.data.token}}
@userToken = {{loginUser.response.body.$.data.token}}

### --- Products (require Bearer token) ---

### List all (default page) — Admin or User
GET {{Mec126_HostAddress}}/api/products
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Pagination — page 1, 2 items per page
GET {{Mec126_HostAddress}}/api/products?page=1&pageSize=2
Accept: application/json

###

### Pagination — page 2
GET {{Mec126_HostAddress}}/api/products?page=2&pageSize=2
Accept: application/json

###

### Sort by price descending
GET {{Mec126_HostAddress}}/api/products?sortBy=price&sortDir=desc
Accept: application/json

###

### Filter + sort + pagination
GET {{Mec126_HostAddress}}/api/products?minPrice=10&sortBy=name&sortDir=asc&page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

###

### Get by id — Admin or User
GET {{Mec126_HostAddress}}/api/products/1
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### User tries to create — expect 403 Forbidden
POST {{Mec126_HostAddress}}/api/products
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Blocked by role",
  "price": 9.99
}

###

### Create product — Admin only (403 if you use user token)
POST {{Mec126_HostAddress}}/api/products
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Headphones",
  "price": 45.99,
  "category": "Tech",
  "description": "Wireless headphones"
}

###

### Validation error — missing name
POST {{Mec126_HostAddress}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 10
}

###

### Validation error — invalid price
POST {{Mec126_HostAddress}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Bad Price Item",
  "price": 0
}

###
